  R10 (P2-27, census C1b) D, kappa_eff and k_eff are DEREGISTERED: no `D_mf`, `kappa_eff_mf`, `k_eff_mf`, `ic_damage`,
     `RefreshKappaEff` or `keff_out` anywhere in src/, and no RegisterNewFab names "D", "kappa_eff" or "k_eff"
Each clause has a MUTATION that must turn it RED, and the full revert turns every clause RED. With --pre <dir>
