  K31 with beta / E / mu given -> rc == 0
  P2-28 (census H, the column path deleted): R11 (source) + two-sided K legs on the gradient_blind FACE deck:
  R11 no column-only name in src/ (comments included, string literals excluded), Removal.H deleted, each retired key
       string once as a quoted literal (the table: spall.surface_T reconstructed, spall.removal_energy flake,
